WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.600
Qo‘llanma 1/4. Ilovani yuklab olish.

2
00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.200
1. Telefoningizda brauzerni oching va bugunbor.uz saytiga kiring.

3
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:10.109
2. Pastga tushing va «BugunBor ilovasi» bo‘limida «Android ilova» tugmasini bosing.

4
00:00:10.109 --> 00:00:13.105
3. «Android ilovani yuklab olish» tugmasini bosing. Fayl hajmi taxminan 30 MB.

5
00:00:13.105 --> 00:00:16.530
4. Brauzer ogohlantirsa, «Baribir yuklab olish»ni bosing. Faylni faqat bugunbor.uz’dan yuklab oling.

6
00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:20.915
5. Yuklab bo‘lingach, «Ochish»ni bosing.

7
00:00:20.915 --> 00:00:24.540
6. Telefon ruxsat so‘rasa, «Sozlamalar»ni bosing. Oynalar telefonga qarab biroz boshqacha bo‘lishi mumkin.

8
00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:29.590
7. «Shu manbadan ruxsat berish»ni yoqing va orqaga qayting. Bu bir marta so‘raladi.

9
00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:32.415
8. «O‘rnatish»ni bosing.

10
00:00:32.415 --> 00:00:39.894
9. Play Protect ogohlantirsa, «Batafsil» → «Baribir o‘rnatish»ni bosing. Ilova hali Google Play’da bo‘lmagani uchun shunday chiqadi.

11
00:00:39.894 --> 00:00:42.719
10. Ilova o‘rnatildi. «Ochish»ni bosing.

12
00:00:42.719 --> 00:00:47.865
11. Ilova ochiladi. Tilni tanlang va «Keyingi»ni bosing.

13
00:00:47.865 --> 00:00:53.137
12. Sizga nima yoqishini belgilang — mos aksiyalar birinchi chiqadi.

14
00:00:53.137 --> 00:00:59.674
13. Joylashuvga ruxsat bering yoki shaharni o‘zingiz tanlang.

15
00:00:59.674 --> 00:01:02.674
Tayyor! Yaqin atrofdagi aksiyalar shu yerda.

16
00:01:02.674 --> 00:01:05.874
Tayyor! Keyingi: ro‘yxatdan o‘tish.
